WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.548
Step 1. Open the purchase delivery.

1.2
00:00:02.548 --> 00:00:07.208
You approve the delivery first, and then receive the items that arrive.

1.3
00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:32.800
In the Created tab, select View Details for the delivery.

2.1
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.865
Step 2. Approve the delivery. Select Mark as Approved.

2.2
00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:42.311
The status becomes Pending, and you can no longer add or change items.

3.1
00:00:42.311 --> 00:00:47.288
Step 3. Select the items you receive. Care ticks every item.

3.2
00:00:47.288 --> 00:00:50.625
Untick any item that did not arrive.

4.1
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:52.667
Step 4. Receive the items.

4.2
00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:58.114
Select Receive and Update Stock, choose the receiving status and the condition,

4.3
00:00:58.114 --> 00:01:02.819
and confirm. Care adds the quantity to the store's stock now.

5.1
00:01:02.819 --> 00:01:05.237
Step 5. Complete the delivery.

5.2
00:01:05.237 --> 00:01:09.574
When no item is still in progress, select Mark as Completed.

5.3
00:01:09.574 --> 00:01:13.543
This closes the delivery and adds no more stock.
